ue (AOV)"}]," than acquisition campaigns (Omnisend, 2024). Why? Because they're sent to people who've already:"]}],["$","p","15",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Vouched for your brand with their wallet"]}],["$","p","16",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Shared preferences (browsing history, purchase frequency, category affinity)"]}],["$","p","17",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Given you permission to engage meaningfully"]}],["$","p","19",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["This trust and behavioral data let you personalize at scale--something cold acquisition emails simply can't replicate."]}],["$","hr","21",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","h2","23",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"5 High-Impact Customer Retention Email Strategies (With Examples & Metrics)"}],["$","h3","25",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-8 mb-3","children":"1. **The Post-Purchase \"Value-Add\" Sequence**"}],["$","p","27",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Don't stop at the order confirmation. A well-timed 3-email sequence *after* purchase increases repeat purchase likelihood by ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"27%"}],", per SaleCycle."]}],["$","p","29",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["✅ ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Actionable Template:"}],""]}],["$","p","30",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ","$L17"," Order confirmation + *\"How to get the most from your [product]\"* video or quick-start guide"]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L